          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೋಳ — tōḷa — \"a wolf\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೋಳಗಳು ರಾತ್ರಿ ಗುಂಪಿನಲ್ಲಿ ತಿರುಗುತ್ತವೆ. tōḷagaḷu rātri gumpinalli tiruguttave. Wolves roam about in packs at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ತೋಳಗಳು, tōḷagaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The plural takes -ಗಳು: ತೋಳಗಳು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೋಳ (tōḷa) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3548 lists Kannada tōḷa, \"a wolf\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
