          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಘರ್ಜಿಸು (gharjisu) is built from Sanskrit garj, \"to thunder, to roar\" (CDIAL 4046, garjati), with the verb ending -isu; Kannada writes it with the aspirate ಘ."
